('Roasted Cashew Nuts - Salted (500g)', 'roasted-cashew-nuts-salted-500g', 'Premium roasted cashew nuts from the Konkan region of Goa. Medium-sized, crunchy, and perfectly salted. Sourced from local cashew farms and roasted to golden perfection.', 'Premium roasted salted cashews - 500g, Goan cashews', 549.00, 699.00, 500, 'CAS-ROS-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Goa', 180, 'Cashew Nuts, Salt, Vegetable Oil', '{"calories": 160, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "5g", "fat": "13g", "fiber": "1g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.60, 120, 3500, 28000),
('Raw Cashew Nuts - Premium (500g)', 'raw-cashew-nuts-premium-500g', 'Premium raw cashew nuts (Kaju) directly from Konkan cashew farms. W180 grade, large and white. Perfect for making cashew milk, vegan cheese, or homemade roasted cashews.', 'Premium raw cashews - 500g, W180 grade', 499.00, 629.00, 400, 'CAS-RAW-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 1, 1, 0, 1, 'Goa', 365, '100% Raw Cashew Nuts', '{"calories": 155, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "5g", "fat": "12g", "fiber": "1g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place. Refrigerate for longer shelf life.', 4.50, 75, 2800, 22000),
('Masala Cashew Nuts (500g)', 'masala-cashew-nuts-500g', 'Spiced masala cashew nuts from Konkan. Roasted with a traditional blend of Indian spices - chaat masala, black pepper, and red chili. A perfect party snack.', 'Spiced masala cashews - 500g, Konkan style', 599.00, 749.00, 300, 'CAS-MAS-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Goa', 180, 'Cashew Nuts, Chaat Masala, Black Pepper, Red Chili, Salt, Oil', '{"calories": 165, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "5g", "fat": "13g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.50, 45, 2000, 15000),
('Honey Roasted Cashews (500g)', 'honey-roasted-cashews-500g', 'Premium Konkan cashews roasted with a light coating of pure honey and a hint of salt. Sweet and savory combination that makes an irresistible snack.', 'Honey roasted cashews - 500g, sweet and savory', 649.00, 799.00, 250, 'CAS-HON-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Goa', 180, 'Cashew Nuts, Honey, Sugar, Salt, Oil', '{"calories": 170, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "4g", "fat": "12g", "sugar": "6g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.40, 30, 1500, 10000),
('Cashew Feni - Premium (750ml)', 'cashew-feni-premium-750ml', 'Premium cashew Feni from Goa, distilled from the fermented juice of cashew apples. A traditional Goan spirit with a distinct fruity aroma and smooth finish. Double distilled for premium quality.', 'Premium Goan Cashew Feni - 750ml, double distilled', 899.00, 1099.00, 100, 'CAS-FEN-001', 7, 'Goan Heritage', 750, 'bottle', 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Goa', 3650, 'Distilled Cashew Apple Ferment', '{"alcohol": "42.8% ABV", "calories": 70, "serving_size": "30ml"}', 'Store in cool dark place away from direct sunlight.', 4.30, 25, 500, 8000),
('Cashew Pieces - Cooking Grade (500g)', 'cashew-pieces-cooking-grade-500g', 'Premium broken cashew pieces from Konkan. Ideal for cooking, making cashew cream, garnishing desserts, and adding to curries. Same premium quality at a more affordable price.', 'Cashew pieces for cooking - 500g, great value', 399.00, 499.00, 600, 'CAS-PCS-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Goa', 365, 'Cashew Pieces', '{"calories": 155, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "5g", "fat": "12g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.30, 40, 2000, 8000),
('Cashew Butter - Unsweetened (250g)', 'cashew-butter-unsweetened-250g', 'Pure cashew butter made from roasted Konkan cashews. No added sugar, oil, or preservatives. Creamy, nutty, and rich. Perfect spread on toast or addition to smoothies.', 'Pure cashew butter - 250g, unsweetened, creamy', 449.00, 549.00, 200, 'CAS-BUT-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 250, 'jar', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Goa', 180, '100% Roasted Cashew Nuts', '{"calories": 180, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "6g", "fat": "15g", "fiber": "1g"}', 'Store in cool dry place. Natural oil separation is normal - stir before use.', 4.30, 15, 400, 3500),
('Kaju Katli - Premium (500g)', 'kaju-katli-premium-500g', 'Premium Kaju Katli made from fresh Konkan cashew paste and pure ghee. Soft, melt-in-the-mouth texture with authentic taste. Adorned with silver vark. Perfect festival gift.', 'Premium Kaju Katli - 500g, authentic cashew sweet', 799.00, 999.00, 150, 'CAS-KAT-001', 7, 'Konkan Heritage', 500, 'box', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Goa', 45, 'Cashew Paste, Sugar, Ghee, Cardamom, Silver Vark', '{"calories": 120, "serving_size": "25g", "sugar": "10g", "fat": "7g"}', 'Store in cool dry place in airtight container. Refrigerate for longer shelf life.', 4.60, 35, 800, 6000),
('Cashew Milk - Unsweetened (1L)', 'cashew-milk-unsweetened-1l', 'Creamy cashew milk made from premium Konkan cashews. Dairy-free, lactose-free, and vegan. No added sugar. Perfect for coffee, cereal, and smoothies.', 'Unsweetened cashew milk - 1L, dairy-free', 249.00, 299.00, 200, 'CAS-MLK-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 1000, 'carton', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Goa', 120, 'Filtered Water, Cashews, Sea Salt', '{"calories": 35, "serving_size": "240ml", "protein": "1g", "fat": "3g"}', 'Refrigerate. Shake well before use. Consume within 7 days of opening.', 4.10, 10, 250, 2200),
('Almonds - Mamra (500g)', 'almonds-mamra-500g', 'Premium Mamra almonds from the Konkan region. Small, sweet, and nutrient-dense. Known for their superior taste and higher oil content compared to regular almonds.', 'Premium Mamra almonds - 500g, sweet and nutrient-rich', 649.00, 799.00, 200, 'CAS-ALM-001', 7, 'Konkan Bazaar Select', 500, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Sindhudurg', 365, 'Mamra Almonds', '{"calories": 165, "serving_size": "30g", "protein": "6g", "fat": "14g", "vitamin_e": "7.5mg"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.40, 15, 500, 3500);
