('Organic Black Pepper - Whole (200g)', 'organic-black-pepper-whole-200g', 'Premium organic black pepper from the spice gardens of Konkan. Bold, aromatic peppercorns with high piperine content. Freshly harvested and sun-dried.', 'Organic whole black pepper - 200g, Konkan spice gardens', 299.00, 379.00, 400, 'SPI-PEP-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 1, 1, 0, 1, 'Sindhudurg', 730, 'Organic Black Peppercorns', '{"calories": 5, "serving_size": "2g", "fiber": "0.5g", "piperine": "High"}', 'Store in airtight container away from sunlight. Grind fresh for best flavor.', 4.60, 80, 2500, 18000),
('Fresh Turmeric Root (500g)', 'fresh-turmeric-root-500g', 'Fresh organic turmeric root from Konkan farms. Bright orange flesh with high curcumin content. Used fresh in cooking, teas, and traditional remedies.', 'Fresh organic turmeric root - 500g, high curcumin', 149.00, 189.00, 300, 'SPI-TUR-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 500, 'pack', 0, 1, 0, 1, 'Goa', 21, 'Fresh Turmeric Root', '{"calories": 10, "serving_size": "10g", "curcumin": "High", "fiber": "0.5g"}', 'Store in refrigerator in paper bag. Can be frozen for longer storage.', 4.40, 30, 1200, 8000),
('Organic Red Chili Powder (200g)', 'organic-red-chili-powder-200g', 'Premium organic red chili powder made from Konkan-grown Byadgi chilies. Vibrant red color with moderate heat. Authentic spice essential for Konkan cuisine.', 'Organic Byadgi chili powder - 200g, vibrant red', 149.00, 189.00, 500, 'SPI-CHP-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 0, 1, 0, 1, 'Ratnagiri', 540, 'Organic Byadgi Red Chilies', '{"calories": 10, "serving_size": "5g", "vitamin_a": "500mcg", "capsaicin": "Moderate"}', 'Store in airtight container away from sunlight.', 4.30, 35, 1500, 7000),
('Coriander Seeds - Whole (200g)', 'coriander-seeds-whole-200g', 'Premium whole coriander seeds from the Konkan region. Aromatic and flavorful, freshly harvested from organic farms. Essential for spice blends and cooking.', 'Aromatic coriander seeds - 200g, Konkan grown', 89.00, 109.00, 600, 'SPI-COR-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Sindhudurg', 730, 'Organic Coriander Seeds', '{"calories": 5, "serving_size": "5g", "fiber": "1g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.20, 15, 600, 3500),
('Cumin Seeds - Jeera (200g)', 'cumin-seeds-jeera-200g', 'Premium cumin seeds from Konkan farms. Strong, aromatic, and freshly harvested. An essential spice for all Indian cooking.', 'Premium cumin seeds - 200g, aromatic Konkan jeera', 99.00, 129.00, 600, 'SPI-CUM-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Ratnagiri', 730, 'Organic Cumin Seeds', '{"calories": 8, "serving_size": "5g", "iron": "1.5mg"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.10, 12, 500, 3000),
('Konkan Garam Masala - Blend (200g)', 'konkan-garam-masala-blend-200g', 'Special Konkan-style garam masala blend made with traditional coastal spices. Cardamom, cinnamon, cloves, nutmeg, and pepper from the region. Perfect for Konkan curries.', 'Konkan-style garam masala - 200g, coastal blend', 199.00, 249.00, 400, 'SPI-GRM-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 0, 1, 0, 0, 'Goa', 540, 'Cardamom, Cinnamon, Cloves, Nutmeg, Black Pepper, Mace, Bay Leaf', '{"calories": 8, "serving_size": "5g"}', 'Store in airtight container away from sunlight.', 4.50, 40, 1800, 6500),
('Goda Masala - Konkan Special (200g)', 'goda-masala-konkan-special-200g', 'Authentic Goda masala, a traditional Konkan spice blend. Sweet, aromatic, and mild. Essential for Malvani and Konkan cuisine. Made with 15+ spices.', 'Authentic Goda masala - 200g, Konkan special blend', 179.00, 219.00, 350, 'SPI-GOD-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 1, 1, 0, 0, 'Sindhudurg', 540, 'Coriander, Cumin, Pepper, Cloves, Cardamom, Cinnamon, Bay Leaf, Sesame, Coconut, Mace', '{"calories": 10, "serving_size": "5g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.60, 50, 2000, 8000),
('Whole Cardamom - Green (100g)', 'whole-cardamom-green-100g', 'Premium green cardamom (Elaichi) from the Konkan region. Highly aromatic with intense essential oils. Perfect for sweets, chai, and biryani.', 'Premium green cardamom - 100g, highly aromatic', 449.00, 549.00, 200, 'SPI-CRD-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 100, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Goa', 730, 'Green Cardamom Pods', '{"calories": 5, "serving_size": "2g", "essential_oils": "High"}', 'Store in airtight container away from sunlight and moisture.', 4.40, 18, 600, 4000),
('Cloves - Laung (100g)', 'cloves-laung-100g', 'Premium cloves from the Konkan spice gardens. Dark brown, oil-rich with intense aroma. Handpicked and sun-dried for premium quality.', 'Premium cloves - 100g, Konkan spice garden', 199.00, 249.00, 300, 'SPI-CLO-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 100, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Sindhudurg', 730, 'Whole Cloves', '{"calories": 5, "serving_size": "2g", "eugenol": "High"}', 'Store in airtight container away from light.', 4.20, 12, 400, 2800),
('Cinnamon Sticks - Dalchini (100g)', 'cinnamon-sticks-dalchini-100g', 'Premium cinnamon sticks (Dalchini) from Konkan region. Thin, layered bark with sweet, warm flavor. Perfect for biryani, chai, and desserts.', 'Premium cinnamon sticks - 100g, Konkan grown', 149.00, 189.00, 350, 'SPI-CIN-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 100, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Ratnagiri', 730, 'Cinnamon Sticks', '{"calories": 5, "serving_size": "2g", "fiber": "1g"}', 'Store in airtight container in cool dry place.', 4.10, 10, 350, 2200),
('Dry Red Byadgi Chili (200g)', 'dry-red-byadgi-chili-200g', 'Premium Byadgi red chilies from Konkan farms. Deep red color, mild heat, and rich color. Essential for authentic Konkan cuisine and giving vibrant red color to dishes.', 'Byadgi red chilies - 200g, vibrant color, mild heat', 129.00, 159.00, 400, 'SPI-BYD-001', 8, 'Konkan Heritage', 200, 'pack', 0, 0, 0, 1, 'Ratnagiri', 540, 'Dried Byadgi Red Chilies', '{"calories": 10, "serving_size": "5g", "vitamin_a": "High"}', 'Store in airtight container away from moisture.', 4.20, 15, 500, 3000);
